MODULE: DigestIgnoresDivergence
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the digest comparison reports a match although content diverged
PERTURBS: ProbeCompare

--- FIND
    /\ IF Diverged # {} THEN phase' = "mismatch" ELSE phase' \in {"idle", "mismatch"}
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase' = "idle"
--- END
